{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dawn breaks, but the darkness never recedes. Brave the endless night with your allies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightfall Survivor is a co-op roguelike survival game for up to 3 players, set in an ethereal atmosphere. Fend off waves of encroaching monsters and break your limits by combining skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Combat System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic skills fire automatically, helping you survive, while certain powerful skills can be aimed manually for those decisive moments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/4510f90b073afa3e6491794a2f69b680.poster.avif?t=1754958566\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/4510f90b073afa3e6491794a2f69b680.webm?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/4510f90b073afa3e6491794a2f69b680.mp4?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/5f0ffae0a74d44e85c1c6b62c525593c.poster.avif?t=1754958566\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/5f0ffae0a74d44e85c1c6b62c525593c.webm?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/5f0ffae0a74d44e85c1c6b62c525593c.mp4?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together: Up to 3-Player Co-op</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to challenge the endless night. Unleash more firepower, wipe out your foes, and clear the round to bring your comrades back into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/7864ecdcb790cb80fbb76798cddd03ee.poster.avif?t=1754958566\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/7864ecdcb790cb80fbb76798cddd03ee.webm?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/7864ecdcb790cb80fbb76798cddd03ee.mp4?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two strategic choices await you after every round. First, set the direction of your build by choosing one of three skills offered upon leveling up. Next, complete your strategy by purchasing items from the shop with the resources you've gathered, and prepare to take on the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/20d6cabd5e34dbeebba81f2911681074.poster.avif?t=1754958566\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/20d6cabd5e34dbeebba81f2911681074.webm?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/extras/20d6cabd5e34dbeebba81f2911681074.mp4?t=1754958566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Art</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a mysterious and beautiful world, brought to life with stylized low-poly 3D graphics that perfectly captures the game's atmosphere.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can your teamwork light up the dawn? </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852890?t=1754958566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852890?t=1754958566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/54edac97e0513878b70fae0188ef0262d3da3ba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754958566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852890/54edac97e0513878b70fae0188ef0262d3da3ba4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754958566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dawn breaks, but the darkness never recedes. Brave the endless night with your allies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightfall Survivor is a co-op roguelike survival game for up to 3 players, set in an ethereal atmosphere. Fend off waves of encroaching monsters and break your limits by combining skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Combat System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic skills fire automatically, helping you survive, while certain powerful skills can be aimed manually for those decisive moments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar